        "Content": "RAY COOKE LETTINGS ADVERTISE PROPERTIES ON FACEBOOK & INSTAGRAM FIRST SO PLEASE MAKE SURE YOU ARE FOLLOWING US THERE VIDEO VIEWINGS AVAILABLE ON REQUEST\nRAY COOKE LETTINGS are delighted to present this fantastic 2 Bed / 1 Bath apartment to the rental market, located right in the heart of Rathmines, Dublin 6.\nThis fantastic property comprises a bright, spacious open-plan living/dining area, a fully fitted kitchen with integrated appliances, two well-proportioned double bedrooms, and a fully tiled bathroom. It has been recently renovated to a high standard with brand new furnishings and fittings throughout, and is ready to go immediately. \nIn terms of location, Rathmines is one of Dublin's most sought-after and vibrant suburbs, with Grosvenor Place ideally located just off Rathmines Road. It is within a 5-10 minute walk of Rathmines village wide a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurant, bars, and The Swan Shopping Centre. Ranelagh Luas stop is just a 10-15 minute walk away for direct access to Dublin City Centre, which can also be reached in 30 minutes on foot, or just 10 minutes by bike. \nFeatures:\n1.2 Bed / 1 Bath Apartment\n2.Recently renovated to a high standard\n3.Fully Furnished Throughout\n4.On-street Parking (eligible for DCC permit)\n5.Open-Plan Living/Dining Area\n6.Fully Fitted Kitchen with Integrated Appliances incl. Dishwasher\n7.Highly Sought-After Location\n8.Walking distance to Shops, Cafes, Restaurants & Bars\n9.15 min walk to Ranelagh Luas Stop\n10.Excellent Dublin Bus Links of its Doorstep\nENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY PLEASE.\n"
      },
